# Synthetic coordinator BENCH_EVENT stream for scripts/lag-slo-verdict.py
# (issue #215; gather provenance per issue #222). Hand-written; the parser
# ignores non-event/non-BENCH lines so these '#' comments are inert. GROUND
# TRUTH (pinned here AND in scripts/tests/test_lag_slo_verdict.py):
#
#   lag_block = GATHER + fold.merge_ms + fold.l4_ms
#
#   Issue #222: GATHER is the coordinator's REAL measured gather wall, read
#   from the per-block `stream_summary` block_complete record's `block_wall_ms`
#   keyed by height -- NOT the slowest-chunk-lag proxy. Every measured block
#   below carries a `block_complete` summary, so gather_source == "measured"
#   for all of them (gather_source=auto picks the real measured wall). The
#   chunk_proven.lag_ms values are LOWER than block_wall_ms on purpose: they
#   are the slowest single cell's lag, which the proxy would have used; the
#   measured wall is higher because it includes coordination time after the
#   last cell lands. Asserting the lag uses block_wall_ms (not lag_ms) proves
#   the measured path, not the proxy, is taken.
#
#   height  gather(meas)  chunk_lag(proxy)  merge   l4     lag_ms  gsrc
#   100     8000          7600              3000    4000   15000   measured
#   101     7000          6500              3500    4500   15000   measured
#   102     9000          8600              3000    4000   16000   measured
#   103     9000          8700              3200    4300   16500   measured
#   104    10000          9600              3300    4400   17700   measured
#   105    11000         10600              3400    4600   19000   measured
#   106    12000         11500                 0       0       -   MODELED->EXCLUDED
#
#   sorted measured lags (ms): [15000,15000,16000,16500,17700,19000] n=6
#   nearest-rank p50 = idx round(0.50*6)-1 = 2 -> 16000 ms = 16.000 s
#   nearest-rank p99 = idx round(0.99*6)-1 = 5 -> 19000 ms = 19.000 s
#   excluded modeled count = 1 (height 106)
#   proxy_gather_count = 0 (every measured block uses the real measured wall)
#   throughput_tx_s (last/final stream_summary) = 56.0
#   observed blocks/s = 6 / elapsed_s(final=1.2) = 5.000 >= 5  -> keep-pace
#   verdict vs 20/40 s @ >=5 blk/s = PASS  (p50 16 < 18, p99 19 < 38)
#   BENCH_METRIC: one each of fold_barrier / fold_transit / fold_storage
